    "congress": 118,
    "constitutionalAuthorityStatementText": "<pre>\n[Congressional Record Volume 170, Number 82 (Friday, May 10, 2024)]\n[House]\nFrom the Congressional Record Online through the Government Publishing Office [<a href=\"https://www.gpo.gov\">www.gpo.gov</a>]\nBy Ms. HOULAHAN:\nH.R. 8353.\nCongress has the power to enact this legislation pursuant\nto the following:\nSection 1, Article 8 of the Constitution\nThe single subject of this legislation is:\nTo require the Election Assistance Commission to develop\nvoluntary guidelines for the administration of elections that\naddress the use and risks of artificial intelligence\ntechnologies, and for other purposes.\n[Page H3006]\n</pre>",
